<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Disappear</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">1nonly</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">Shady Moon</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v3">Junya Shii</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">Homesick</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">2iRi7iqoZsHW9zZlLSfRjU</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.012" end="00:08.200" ttm:agent="v1">It's funny how all I see is faces</p>
      <p begin="00:08.200" end="00:15.642" ttm:agent="v1">'Be if I go away, I could disappear with no traces</p>
      <p begin="00:15.642" end="00:17.142" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="00:15.909" end="00:17.767" ttm:agent="v1">If I disappear from this world, would you think about me?</p>
      <p begin="00:17.767" end="00:23.112" ttm:agent="v1">And I know that it's selfish, but it's so funny that you never get the hints that I'll leave when I'm gone</p>
      <p begin="00:23.112" end="00:24.612" ttm:agent="v1">What's the cost, am I helpless?</p>
      <p begin="00:23.925" end="00:25.824" ttm:agent="v1">And you've always said I was the one for you</p>
      <p begin="00:25.824" end="00:27.447" ttm:agent="v1">When my time comes, know I did it all for you</p>
      <p begin="00:27.447" end="00:29.609" ttm:agent="v1">Said &quot;**** you&quot; once, now you on the loose</p>
      <p begin="00:29.609" end="00:31.499" ttm:agent="v1">Only the money that I make keep me off a noose</p>
      <p begin="00:31.499" end="00:32.999" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Shady Moon]</p>
      <p begin="00:31.779" end="00:33.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">If I disappear from your life, would you chase me? (Would you chase me?)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.382" end="00:35.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Even if you don't feel the same, you better tell me (Fine)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.242" end="00:37.130" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna fall, or be lied to</p>
      <p begin="00:37.130" end="00:39.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The songs that I write for you are saying &quot;Help me&quot; (Damn)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.280" end="00:41.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Girl, let's talk it out, change it up for the one time (One time)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.434" end="00:43.876" ttm:agent="v1">You always tryna argue with me through the whole night</p>
      <p begin="00:43.876" end="00:46.044" ttm:agent="v1">I'll slide through when you need me, I won't pass by</p>
      <p begin="00:46.044" end="00:47.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You know I'll always show up in the long ride (Shady)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.686" end="00:49.186" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause, bitch, you my ride forever</p>
      <p begin="00:48.775" end="00:51.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't wanna see you posted up with another man that's not me (Hello?)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.457" end="00:55.185" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">This money come clutch, but it's not enough, girl, I need you here, I don't wanna feel this lonely (Ha)</p>
      <p begin="00:55.185" end="00:58.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Whenever you around, it's a feeling that no other could create 'cause your heart took away my blue (My blue)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.962" end="01:02.983" ttm:agent="v1">I wish we'd stay together, but I know our lifestyle is different, but I wonder if we see that shit through</p>
      <p begin="01:02.983" end="01:06.195" ttm:agent="v1">But I would never let you go</p>
      <p begin="01:06.195" end="01:09.919" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you steady runnin' in my mind</p>
      <p begin="01:09.919" end="01:13.978" ttm:agent="v1">Can you tell me why it's always cold?</p>
      <p begin="01:13.978" end="01:18.009" ttm:agent="v1">It's 'cause you not right here by my side</p>
      <p begin="01:18.009" end="01:22.040" ttm:agent="v1">But I would never let you go</p>
      <p begin="01:22.040" end="01:26.053" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you steady runnin' in my mind</p>
      <p begin="01:26.053" end="01:29.807" ttm:agent="v1">Can you tell me why it's always cold?</p>
      <p begin="01:29.807" end="01:33.805" ttm:agent="v1">It's 'cause you not right here by my side</p>
      <p begin="01:33.805" end="01:35.305" ttm:agent="v1">[Outro: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="01:34.356" end="01:37.549" ttm:agent="v1">If I disappear from this world, would you think about me?</p>
      <p begin="01:37.549" end="01:41.846" ttm:agent="v1">And I know that it's selfish, but it's so funny that you never get the hints that I'll leave when I'm gone</p>
      <p begin="01:41.846" end="01:43.346" ttm:agent="v1">What's the cost, am I helpless?</p>
      <p begin="01:42.912" end="01:45.585" ttm:agent="v1">And you've always said I was the one for you</p>
      <p begin="01:45.585" end="01:47.429" ttm:agent="v1">When my time comes, know I did it all for you</p>
      <p begin="01:47.429" end="01:49.577" ttm:agent="v1">Said &quot;**** you&quot; once, now you on the loose</p>
      <p begin="01:49.577" end="01:53.577" ttm:agent="v1">Only the money that I make keep me off a noose</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
